This project bundles no third-party source code. Runtime dependencies are
resolved at build time from the `requirements.txt` files under
`backend/lambda/functions/` and from `frontend/search-demo/package.json`.

No 3D assets are included. `asset-examples/` carries only a README pointing at
third-party sources; obtain models under their own licences.

Notices for dependencies whose licenses require attribution:

## Blender

- License: GPL-3.0-or-later (https://www.blender.org/about/license/)
- Source: https://download.blender.org/release/Blender4.0/
- Used by: `backend/lambda/functions/blender-render/`

Blender is **not** redistributed by this repository. The container image
definition downloads an official release at build time, and the render function
invokes the `blender` executable as a separate process (`subprocess.run`) rather
than linking against it, so no part of this project is a derivative work of
Blender. A container image you build from this repository does contain Blender,
and redistributing that image would carry Blender's GPL obligations — this sample
expects you to build the image in your own account and not redistribute it.

